OL,3,GNEWSATwo men cleared over Christmas Day
OL,4,Adrive-by shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been cleared of attempted
OL,7,Fmurder in connection with a drive-by
OL,8,Fshooting on Christmas Day last year
OL,9,Fwhich left a man with life-changing
OL,10,Finjuries.
OL,12,FA 21-year-old man was shot in the chest
OL,13,Fon Wilfred Drive in the Darnall area of
OL,14,FSheffield at about 23:30 GMT on 25
OL,15,FDecember.
OL,17,FRaheel Mahmood and Samin Khan, both 24
OL,18,Fand from Sheffield, were later charged
OL,19,Fwith attempted murder and possessing a
OL,20,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
