OL,3,GNEWSATwo men cleared over Christmas Day
OL,4,Adrive-by shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, after a trial at Sheffield
OL,7,FCrown Court, they were both found not
OL,8,Fguilty by a jury of all offences.
